\begin_layout Proof
Let 
\begin_inset Formula $M$
\end_inset

 be the maximum singular value of 
\begin_inset Formula $R$
\end_inset

,
 
\begin_inset Formula $m$
\end_inset

 be the minimum singular value of 
\begin_inset Formula $R$
\end_inset

.
 With Min-max theorem of SVD,
 we can approximate 
\family roman
\series medium
\shape up
\size normal
\emph off
\nospellcheck off
